<!--
  Report letterhead overrides.

  The stock external_layout_standard / _boxed / _bold templates already read
  company.logo, company.primary_color, company.secondary_color,
  company.report_header, and company.report_footer. The post_init_hook seeds
  those fields on each existing company with QENEX values, so the rendered
  letterhead is QENEX-branded without any template inheritance here.

  We keep this file as the documented home for future report-template
  overrides. Adding a violet rule to the header was attempted and dropped:
  the stock layouts compose their header class via `t-attf-class`, so it
  is not selectable by inheritance xpath without a fragile string match.
  Brand polish for reports lives in res.company defaults instead.
-->
<odoo/>
